#. module: hr_shift_auto_plan
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_shift_auto_plan/models/shift_planning.py:0
msgid ""
"Auto-plan: %(filled)s shift(s) assigned, %(unfilled)s slot(s) left unfilled "
